text: {seen(crescent1_quadrille) > 1: The old lady in diamonds again, and the quadrille again. "You," she says. "Come along."|An old lady in diamonds takes your arm with surprising strength. "You'll do," she says. "My nephew's vanished, and the quadrille's starting." The dance would take you the length of the ballroom, to the foot of the stairs.}
> left: Make your excuses and slip out
  queue job_way_out now
  say: {seen(crescent1_quadrille) > 1: You tell her you've promised the dance. She snorts. You go.|You plead a turned ankle and limp out of the house, convincingly, all the way down the hill.}
> right: Dance her down the room
  challenge perform apprentice:
    win:
      job_depth += 1
      next
      say: {seen(crescent1_quadrille) > 1: You get through the quadrille without disgrace, and she lets go of you by the stairs. "Nearly adequate," she says.|You get the figures right, mostly, and she's delighted, and leaves you at the foot of the stairs with a rap of her fan and the word "adequate". Nobody is watching the stairs.}
    lose:
      if job_cover > 0:
        queue job_slip now
      else:
        queue job_caught now
      say: {seen(crescent1_quadrille) > 1: You tread on her train, and the diamonds go everywhere, and so do the eyes of the room.|You go left when the whole square goes right, and walk her into the host. Everybody's looking at you now.}

@event crescent1_supper_table
