text: {seen(crescent1_conservatory) > 1: The conservatory again, the orchids, the iron stair. The couple behind the palms are a different couple.|Off the ballroom there's a conservatory, {season == "winter": warm as summer|hot as a kitchen, every pane open}, palms and orchids and a fountain, and in the corner a little iron stair going up into the house. Nobody's here but a couple behind the palms, and they aren't looking.} For a moment the house is only a party.
